/target/
/.idea/
/.vscode/
# Project-metadata entries no checkout may carry. The cooperative write lock is
# machine-local runtime state every Marrow project in this tree creates on its
# first publication; the other four are a publication in flight or the debris
# an interrupted one left, and committing one of them would recreate it in every
# clone — a committed marker makes every read-only command refuse there. Only
# `.marrow/ids` is committed.
**/.marrow/publish.lock
**/.marrow/ids.publish.stage
**/.marrow/ids.publish.quarantine
**/.marrow/ids.pending
**/.marrow/ids.pending.create
*.swp
*.swo
*.tmp
*.exe
*.pdb
.DS_Store
